cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its outputs, please cite the article below.
title: SALGINTR analysis code and codebook
abstract: >-
  Analysis notebooks, variable codebook and analysis specifications for SALGINTR, a
  physician-based digital participatory influenza-like-illness surveillance system in Türkiye,
  covering the 2025/26 season (ISO weeks 40/2025 to 20/2026).
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/salgintr/SALGINTR-2025-2026-analysis
keywords:
  - participatory surveillance
  - influenza-like illness
  - digital epidemiology
  - syndromic surveillance
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    SALGINTR: development and early evaluation of a low-cost cloud-based digital participatory
    surveillance system for influenza-like illness among physicians in Türkiye — a proof of
    concept
  journal: BMC Infectious Diseases
  year: 2026
  volume: 26
  start: 1506
  doi: 10.1186/s12879-026-14153-1
